      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "Security Auditor",
      "to_agent": "Reviewer",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-26T09:40:59Z",
      "notes": [
        "WP-002 security audit: PASS. No Critical or High findings. One Medium design note for the Reviewer: resolveCredential() with an explicit credentialId does not cross-validate the provided URL's host against the credential's configured host — host/credential coherence must be enforced at the call site (orchestrators, WP-005). stripEmbeddedCredentials() is available and must be applied to all git error messages and log output at call sites. No blocking issues for code review."
      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "Reviewer",
      "to_agent": "Documentation",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-26T09:42:13Z",
      "notes": [
        "WP-002 code review: PASS. No blocking issues. Code is clean, well-typed, well-documented, and correctly implements the specified credential resolution strategy.",
        "Two documentation-forward items for the Documentation agent: (1) add a module-level paragraph explaining the resolveCredential → injectCredentialToken call sequence; (2) add a @remarks or SECURITY JSDoc note to resolveCredential() documenting the caller's responsibility to validate host/credential coherence when an explicit credentialId is supplied.",
        "No code changes were made by the Reviewer. All QA-validated behavior is intact."
      ]
    }
  ]
}

